    "url": "https://castellanos.biostatistician.page/posts/target-trial-emulation-reading-list",
    "title": "A short reading list for target trial emulation",
    "excerpt": "Five papers I assign before students design their first emulation.",
    "content": {
      "html": "<p>Start with these, in this order:</p><ol><li><p>Hernán and Robins on using big data to emulate a target trial.</p></li><li><p>The protocol checklist papers, for the components of a trial specification.</p></li><li><p>A worked example with sustained treatment strategies.</p></li><li><p>A paper on immortal time bias, to see what goes wrong without a clear time zero.</p></li><li><p>A critique, so the method does not look like a solved problem.</p></li></ol><p>The full citations are on the <a href=\"/publications\">publications page</a> under the teaching tag.</p>",
      "json": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Start with these, in this order:"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "orderedList",
            "attrs": {
              "start": 1
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Hernán and Robins on using big data to emulate a target trial."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "The protocol checklist papers, for the components of a trial specification."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "A worked example with sustained treatment strategies."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
