    "path": "/posts/sharing-code-with-papers",
    "url": "https://castellanos.biostatistician.page/posts/sharing-code-with-papers",
    "title": "Sharing code with the papers: a checklist",
    "excerpt": "What our group checks before a repository goes public with a paper.",
    "content": {
      "html": "<p>Every paper from our group ships with code. Before a repository goes public we check five things.</p><ul><li><p>It runs from a clean checkout with <code>renv::restore()</code>.</p></li><li><p>Paths are relative.</p></li><li><p>Simulated data stand in for restricted data.</p></li><li><p>The README names the R version.</p></li><li><p>A license file exists.</p></li></ul><hr><p>None of this takes long once it is a habit.</p>",
      "json": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Every paper from our group ships with code. Before a repository goes public we check five things."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "bulletList",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "It runs from a clean checkout with "
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "renv::restore()",
                        "marks": [
                          {
                            "type": "code"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Paths are relative."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Simulated data stand in for restricted data."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "The README names the R version."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "A license file exists."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "horizontalRule"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
